// co.lang.loader is listed in the Builtin Kinds table and given no declaration
// form anywhere in the reference. It is therefore not a MISPLACED declaration and
// the nesting rule must not claim it: telling an author to move it to its own
// source file is advice for a declaration the language does not have.
// DECISION-KIND-001's diagnostic stays authoritative wherever the spelling
// appears.
_ co.lang.class = {

    Thing co.lang.loader = {
        label co.lang.string;
    }
}
